source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Medicinal compositions which show only a weak effect of elevating blood calcium level and, at the same time, can inhibit the proliferation of mesangial cells and the production of mesangium.  Namely, remedies for glomerulosclerosis which contain as the active ingredient 1 alpha ,3 beta -dihydroxy-20 alpha -(3-hydroxy-3-methylbutyloxy)-9,10-seco-5,7,10(19)-pregnatriene.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne des compositions médicamenteuses n'ayant qu'un faible effet sur l'augmentation du taux de calcium dans le sang, et pouvant inhiber en même temps la prolifération de cellules mésangiales et la production de mésangium. En l'occurrence, cette invention concerne des traitements contre la glomérulosclérose contenant comme principe actif 1 alpha ,3 beta -dihydroxy-20 alpha -(3-hydroxy-3-méthylbutyloxy)-9,10-seco-5,7,10(19)-prégnatriène.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>